Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:25.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,启示录 21\N{\fs50}{\i1}Revelation 21.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:30.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我又看见一个新天新地\N{\fs50}{\i1}"And I saw a new heaven and a new Earth.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“因为先前的天地已经过去了\N{\fs50}{\i1}"For the first heaven and the first Earth were passed away.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:38.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我听见有大声音从天上出来说 ‘看哪\N{\fs50}"And I heard a great voice out of heaven say, 'Behold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:42.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“‘神的帐幕\N{\fs50}"'the tabernacle of God
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“‘在人间\N{\fs50}"'is with men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,神要擦去他们一切的眼泪’”\N{\fs50}And God shall wipe away all tears from their eyes.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.53,0:02:03.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的 别怕\N{\fs50}It's okay. It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在这儿 我在\N{\fs50}It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:13.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我对这个段落已经烂熟于心\N{\fs50}I've read this passage too many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还记得下一句经文吗？\N{\fs50}Do you remember what comes next?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:32.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“ ‘神要擦去他们一切的眼泪\N{\fs50}"'And God will wipe away all tears from their eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:34.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“‘不再有死亡\N{\fs50}"'that there will be no more death,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:38.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“‘也不再有悲哀 哭号\N{\fs50}"'neither sorrow, nor crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:41.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“‘也不再有疼痛\N{\fs50}"'neither will there be any more pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为以前的事都过去了’”\N{\fs50}for the former things are passed away.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:47.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你明白经文的意思吗？\N{\fs50}Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:53.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:05.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们什么时候才能安葬他？\N{\fs50}When can we bury him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:19.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在地冻得太硬 很难挖\N{\fs50}The ground is too cold to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:22.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等到春天 我们就会安葬你父亲\N{\fs50}We'll bury your father in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:26.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,保佑你 愿神祝福你\N{\fs50}Bless you, God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:30.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会一起渡过难关的 乔伊斯\N{\fs50}We'll get through this, Joyce.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们还剩多少肉？\N{\fs50}How much do we have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:52.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说鹿肉 马鹿 还有兔子\N{\fs50}Venison, elk, rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,全体居民定量配给的话\N{\fs50}Keep the whole town on rations,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:01.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或许一周吧\N{\fs50}maybe a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:03.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,最多两周了\N{\fs50}Two at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:10.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,约西亚和马丁说他们发现了几头鹿\N{\fs50}Josiah and Martin think they spotted some deer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:13.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,前几晚的事 往东几英里的地方\N{\fs50}the other night, couple miles east.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:15.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当时太暗了\N{\fs50}It was dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能是心理作用\N{\fs50}See what you wanna see sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:20.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,情况大概就是这样\N{\fs50}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fs50}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fs50}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到对我的怀疑\N{\fs50}I sensed doubt in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大卫 人们依然追随你\N{\fs50}They haven't lost faith in ya, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:38.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们只是吓坏了\N{\fs50}They're just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说的不是其他人\N{\fs50}Not from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我仍追随你\N{\fs50}I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:53.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fs50}It's been a--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过去六个月 日子真的很艰难\N{\fs50}The last six months have been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有人都一样\N{\fs50}For all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:03.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我需要确认 你是站在我这边的\N{\fs50}But I need to know you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:07.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:10.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:14.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在去拿枪 我们去打猎\N{\fs50}Now go get our guns. We're goin' huntin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,口渴吗？\N{\fs50}You thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:29.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很快就回来 听到没？\N{\fs50}I'm gonna be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:40.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真他妈难以置信\N{\fs50}No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么想？\N{\fs50}Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:06.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我谁都没看见\N{\fs50}I don't see anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:08.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们直接把它弄回去？\N{\fs50}You think we can just take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:13.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 动作快 射杀这头鹿的人应该就在附近\N{\fs50}Yeah. Quickly. Whoever shot it's probably nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:19.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fs50}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放下枪！\N{\fs50}Drop your rifles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:25.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马上！\N{\fs50}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:34.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,转过身 面朝我 动作慢点\N{\fs50}Turn and face me, slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:38.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你敢轻举妄动 我就射你眉心\N{\fs50}Any sudden moves, I put one right between your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有你的弟兄也是\N{\fs50}Ditto for buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是个好猎人\N{\fs50}You're quite a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:44.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们根本没听到你的脚步声\N{\fs50}We didn't even hear you coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,转过去 走远点\N{\fs50}Turn around and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 成 - 快走\N{\fs50}- Okay. - Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可以 请给我10秒钟 我只想和你谈谈\N{\fs50}Okay, all I ask is 10 seconds of your time. I just wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会再说第二遍\N{\fs50}I won't say it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:53.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托你 10秒钟就好\N{\fs50}Please. Just 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:55.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我叫大卫\N{\fs50}My name is David.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:56.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我的朋友 詹姆斯\N{\fs50}This is my friend, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:00.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们有一大群人要照看 有妇女 儿童\N{\fs50}We're from a larger group: women, children,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:02.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有人 非常 非常饿\N{\fs50}and we're all very, very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也有一大群人要照看\N{\fs50}I'm from a large group, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:07.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,同样饿坏了\N{\fs50}Also hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:12.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就算这样 你也没办法独自一人把鹿拖回去\N{\fs50}Well, even so, ya can't drag this back on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不是要白拿\N{\fs50}We're not asking for charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可以和你交易\N{\fs50}We can trade you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:17.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来换一些鹿肉 我们有——\N{\fs50}for some of the deer. We have--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你需要什么？我们有靴子\N{\fs50}What do you need? We have boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:21.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,药有吗？\N{\fs50}Medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:24.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,控制伤口感染的药\N{\fs50}Like, for infections.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有 在村子里\N{\fs50}We do. Back in our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,欢迎你和我们一起过去\N{\fs50}You're welcome to follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不打算跟你们去任何地方\N{\fs50}I'm not following you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你那弟兄可以去拿\N{\fs50}Buddy boy can go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他回来 你们就拿走一半鹿肉\N{\fs50}He comes back, you get half the deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要是有其他人出现 我就——\N{\fs50}Anyone else shows up, I put one--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,射我眉心\N{\fs50}Put one right between my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:47.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 你去和霍华德说一声\N{\fs50}All right, go talk to Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他有个箱子 里边有青霉素\N{\fs50}He's got a case with some penicillin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拿上两瓶 再拿一个注射器\N{\fs50}Bring back two bottles and a syringe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:57.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是暗号 詹姆斯 照我说的做\N{\fs50}It's not code, James. Do as I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,往后退十步\N{\fs50}Ten steps back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:18.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fs50}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你拿着你爸的枪？\N{\fs50}That's your dad's gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,生病的就是他？\N{\fs50}He the one that's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你才独自出外打猎？\N{\fs50}That's why you're out here on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:32.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fs50}Well, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从这里到我们的营地 来回要四英里\N{\fs50}it's a four-mile round trip back to our settlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:38.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯要花很长时间才能回得来\N{\fs50}It's gonna be a while before James gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:40.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我包里带了油和火柴\N{\fs50}I have some oil and matches in my pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:42.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以去那边避避寒\N{\fs50}We could take shelter,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:44.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,生个火\N{\fs50}start a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.62,0:11:52.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带上这头鹿\N{\fs50}Bring him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:53.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fs50}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:17.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说 你真不应该一个人外出\N{\fs50}You know, you really shouldn't be out here all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:19.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从我的角度来看 你也不应该独自在外\N{\fs50}From where I'm sitting, you shouldn't be out here on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:21.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么说没毛病\N{\fs50}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:25.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fs50}So what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,相信陌生人是很难 我明白\N{\fs50}It's hard to trust strangers. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,实话实说 我的确没有恶意\N{\fs50}But I honestly mean you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:36.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实吧 你大可以加入我们的营地\N{\fs50}And for what it's worth, there's room for you in our group,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意的话\N{\fs50}if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在邀请我入伙你们的挨饿俱乐部吗？谢了\N{\fs50}You're inviting me to your Hunger Club? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,的确 我们饥肠辘辘\N{\fs50}It's true. We're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:45.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们依然坚守在这里\N{\fs50}But we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:48.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是个体面人\N{\fs50}I'm a decent man
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:51.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是想要照顾那些依赖我的人而已\N{\fs50}just tryna take care of the people who rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:53.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是他们的头儿？\N{\fs50}You're their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:55.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是他们选的我 不是我自封的\N{\fs50}Wasn't my choice. It was theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:56.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fs50}But
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:58.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fs50}yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:00.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人们“选择追随你”\N{\fs50}They "chose to follow you."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:03.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是哪门子的异教邪典？\N{\fs50}Is this some weird cult thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:06.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 你这么说有点沾边了\N{\fs50}Well, you sorta kinda got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是传教士\N{\fs50}I am a preacher
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:11.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我讲的都是再标准不过的圣经内容\N{\fs50}but just pretty standard Bible stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:13.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咋了？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:15.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,整个世界都完蛋了 你还坚信那些屁话\N{\fs50}The whole world ended and you still believe that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:18.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,实际上我在世界完蛋后才开始信的\N{\fs50}I actually started believing after the world ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在那之前 我是个教师\N{\fs50}Before that, I was a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,教数学 我的学生和你差不多大\N{\fs50}Math. Taught kids about your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:26.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 你从教师变成传教士 是因为？\N{\fs50}So you went from teacher to preacher because, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为押韵？\N{\fs50}It fuckin' rhymes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 正是这样\N{\fs50}Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:32.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,正经答案呢？\N{\fs50}But seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:40.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 在《启示录》应验之后 我才遇见上帝\N{\fs50}Well, I found God, after the Apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,究竟这个时机是好是坏\N{\fs50}which is either the best time or the worst time to find Him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很难说\N{\fs50}hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但2017年匹兹堡隔离区被毁\N{\fs50}But when the Pittsburgh QZ fell in '17,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:50.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这事得追究火萤和FEDRA\N{\fs50}Fireflies and FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当时我和其他几个人离开了\N{\fs50}I left with a few others
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:56.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从此我开始牧养神的群羊\N{\fs50}and that's how I ended up with our flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:58.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从匹兹堡到这儿 真挺远\N{\fs50}Long way from Pittsburgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:04.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 我们曾经在另一个地方落脚 后来被人袭击\N{\fs50}Yeah, we'd settle somewhere, and then raiders would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:06.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,于是又踏上了寻找新家园的路\N{\fs50}so we'd move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:09.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,漫漫路途中 我们的队伍\N{\fs50}And as we wandered, we picked up
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:12.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不断壮大 最后\N{\fs50}new people along the way until,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:14.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们定居在这里了\N{\fs50}we ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,迟早有一天 你们的好运会用完\N{\fs50}Well, your luck had to run out sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:18.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好运吗？\N{\fs50}Luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不认可运气这说法\N{\fs50}There's no such thing as luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:27.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是运气 我相信凡事皆有缘由\N{\fs50}No, I believe everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:30.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fs50}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是真的 我可以证明给你看\N{\fs50}It does. I can prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:33.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:38.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没料到这个冬天会如此残酷\N{\fs50}We didn't expect this winter to be so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:42.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,寸草不生 猎物难寻\N{\fs50}Nothing'll grow. Game’s been hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我派了四个人去附近镇上\N{\fs50}So I sent four of our people to a nearby town
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:48.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看看能不能找到点什么\N{\fs50}to scavenge what they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:51.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,结果只回来了三人\N{\fs50}And only three of 'em came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:54.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,回不来的那人 还是个父亲\N{\fs50}And the one that didn't was a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他有个女儿 和你一样大\N{\fs50}He had a daughter just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:14:59.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,小女孩的父亲永远地离开了她\N{\fs50}And her dad was taken from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,事实上 他被杀害了\N{\fs50}Turns out, he was murdered
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下狠手的是个疯子\N{\fs50}by this crazy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:07.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fs50}And get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:09.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个疯子\N{\fs50}That crazy man
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,身边还有个小女孩\N{\fs50}was traveling with a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你听明白了吗？\N{\fs50}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凡事皆有缘由\N{\fs50}Everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 把枪放下\N{\fs50}James, lower the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是她杀了亚历克 对不对？\N{\fs50}She is the one that killed Alec, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:29.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她没杀任何人\N{\fs50}She didn't kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:32.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fs50}Lower the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你带药来了吗？\N{\fs50}Did you bring the medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:42.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带了 但是——\N{\fs50}Yeah, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:43.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,扔给她\N{\fs50}Throw it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:46.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fs50}David.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fs50}Back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道你们没有同伴\N{\fs50}I know you're not with a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就凭你们 撑不久的\N{\fs50}You won't survive for long out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以保护你\N{\fs50}I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:21.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你让她就这样走了？\N{\fs50}So you're just gonna let her get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 乔尔 这他妈该往哪儿打？\N{\fs50}Okay, the fuck do I put this, Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:02.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:05.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 究竟该他妈往哪儿打？\N{\fs50}Joel, where the fuck do I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:07.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fs50}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:36.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只剩最后五罐了\N{\fs50}Only five more left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fs50}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:53.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,鹿肉\N{\fs50}Venison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一只大家伙\N{\fs50}Big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:44.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你们听说了传言\N{\fs50}If you've heard a rumor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:48.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 我们发现了一个女孩 跟她一起那个男的 杀了亚历克\N{\fs50}yes, we found a girl who was with the man who took Alec from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:52.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,日出之后 我会带队追踪她的下落\N{\fs50}When the sun rises, I'll lead a group out to pick up her trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想必在雪地里不难发现她的去向\N{\fs50}Won't be hard to find in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,顺着脚印就能找到他们的藏身处\N{\fs50}We'll follow it to wherever they're hiding
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:20:00.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后 我们把那人绳之以法\N{\fs50}and we'll bring that man to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:02.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你应该直接杀了他\N{\fs50}You should kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,杀了他俩\N{\fs50}You should kill both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:53.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明白 你觉得自己永远失去了父亲\N{\fs50}I know you think you don't have a father anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:58.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但事实上 汉娜 你从始至终都有一位父亲的\N{\fs50}But the truth is, Hannah, you will always have a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,尤其是当他说话时 你应该尊重他\N{\fs50}And you will show him respect when he's speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.15,0:21:27.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.42,0:21:38.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,主啊 请赐福于我们的食物 让我们……\N{\fs50}Lord, bless this food and grant that we...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:41.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感激您的怜悯及恩典\N{\fs50}May thankful for thy mercies be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:43.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,您教我们得知 是谁以生命喂养我们\N{\fs50}To teach us to know by whom we're fed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:46.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,您赐我们以基督 他就是生命的粮\N{\fs50}bless us with Christ, the living bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fs50}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.16,0:24:14.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,保持警惕\N{\fs50}Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:17.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,万一那人还没死 他可是个狠角色\N{\fs50}If this man's not already dead, he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:19.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么处理那女孩？\N{\fs50}What about the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.45,0:24:21.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把她带回去\N{\fs50}We bring her back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.62,0:24:27.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大卫 你要是不忍心 我没意见\N{\fs50}I don't mean to question your sense of mercy, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.42,0:24:29.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们大可以放了她\N{\fs50}We can let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.88,0:24:32.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要是把她带回去 又多了张吃饭的嘴\N{\fs50}But we bring that girl back with us, she's just another mouth to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.72,0:24:35.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要是我们把她留在这里 她必死无疑\N{\fs50}If we leave her out here, she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:37.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 或许那就是神的旨意\N{\fs50}Yeah, but maybe that's God's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:01.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！乔尔 快醒醒\N{\fs50}Joel! Joel, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.66,0:25:03.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 你他妈快睁眼 乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel, wake the fuck up, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.01,0:25:17.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 好 看着我\N{\fs50}Okay, okay, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.51,0:25:19.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人过来了 明白吗？\N{\fs50}There are men coming, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.43,0:25:22.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会把他们引开 但如果有人下来了\N{\fs50}I'm gonna lead them away from you but if anybody makes it down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.56,0:25:24.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈就杀了他们 明白了吗？\N{\fs50}you fucking kill them. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.81,0:25:26.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:28.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 别睡着了\N{\fs50}Joel, do not fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:49.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.43,0:26:08.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 傻逼们！\N{\fs50}Hey, motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.81,0:26:10.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fs50}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:14.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走！快走\N{\fs50}Go! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:15.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,抓活的！\N{\fs50}Alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.25,0:26:30.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟着来啊 狗逼们！\N{\fs50}Keep comin', fuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:42.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我打中她了！\N{\fs50}I got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.99,0:27:04.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fs50}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.33,0:27:47.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来两个人跟我走 拉上那匹马\N{\fs50}Two of you with me. Drag the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.91,0:27:52.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,剩下的留这儿 挨家挨户地搜\N{\fs50}The rest of you, stay here. Go door to door.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.21,0:27:56.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们不是急着复仇吗？\N{\fs50}You so hungry for vengeance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:27:58.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去干啊\N{\fs50}Deliver it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.53,0:31:12.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都要担心你醒不过来了\N{\fs50}I started worrying you wouldn't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:19.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我出去\N{\fs50}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.66,0:31:22.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这我也想\N{\fs50}Well, that's certainly the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.25,0:31:23.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,饿了吗？\N{\fs50}Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.59,0:31:25.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我为什么在笼子里？\N{\fs50}Why am I in a cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.46,0:31:27.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为我害怕你\N{\fs50}Because I'm afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:30.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你很危险 你已经证明了这点\N{\fs50}You're a dangerous person. You've certainly proven that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.84,0:31:33.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其他人因为之前的事 想让我杀了你\N{\fs50}The others, they want me to kill you for all that's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.56,0:31:40.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说他们想你死 你听见了吗？\N{\fs50}Did you hear me say the others wanna kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.35,0:31:41.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:42.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我阻止了他们\N{\fs50}But I stopped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.75,0:31:44.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fs50}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.02,0:31:47.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你先把名字告诉我吧？\N{\fs50}Why don't we just start with your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:49.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,吃屎去\N{\fs50}Eat shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.28,0:31:51.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 听好了！\N{\fs50}Hey, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.45,0:31:53.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你一个人活不下来\N{\fs50}You can't survive on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.28,0:31:54.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人做得到\N{\fs50}No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.37,0:31:56.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我能帮你\N{\fs50}But I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我保护你\N{\fs50}Let me protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.20,0:32:01.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不是一个人\N{\fs50}I'm not on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.96,0:32:04.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也对 你有朋友\N{\fs50}Right. Your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.79,0:32:08.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他情况怎样？\N{\fs50}And how is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.05,0:32:14.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看得出来你多在乎他\N{\fs50}I can see how much you care about him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.59,0:32:16.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我知道这有多伤心\N{\fs50}so I know it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.06,0:32:18.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,即便如此\N{\fs50}But even so
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.39,0:32:21.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你也得面对现实\N{\fs50}you gotta face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.06,0:32:25.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你生命中的那个阶段要结束了\N{\fs50}That part of your life, it's ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:29.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以给你一个新的开始\N{\fs50}And what I'm offering you is a beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.99,0:32:33.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但如果你做不到信任我\N{\fs50}But if you can't find a way to trust me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.07,0:32:37.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那没错 你还是孤身一人\N{\fs50}then, yes, you are alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,蒂莫西？\N{\fs50}Timothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.62,0:33:18.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 操\N{\fs50}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.17,0:33:35.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求求你 停手吧\N{\fs50}Stop, stop. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:41.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fs50}Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.54,0:33:42.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下一个就是你\N{\fs50}You're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.22,0:33:44.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fs50}Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.39,0:33:46.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么女孩\N{\fs50}I don't know any girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.31,0:33:48.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 噢 我操！ - 老天！\N{\fs50}- Oh, fuck! - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.31,0:33:51.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马可\N{\fs50}Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.05,0:33:52.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不不不不不\N{\fs50}No-no, no-no-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.48,0:33:55.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他帮不了你 你集中注意力\N{\fs50}He can't help you. You focus right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.15,0:33:57.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不然我他妈就废了你的膝盖\N{\fs50}Or I'll pop your fuckin' kneecap off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.53,0:34:02.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fs50}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.49,0:34:04.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.25,0:34:09.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！操！镇子里！\N{\fs50}Fuck! Fuck! The town!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.54,0:34:11.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么镇子？！\N{\fs50}What town?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.75,0:34:13.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,银湖镇\N{\fs50}Silver Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.84,0:34:21.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是镇子的真名\N{\fs50}It's not a real town name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.10,0:34:22.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是个度假村\N{\fs50}It's a resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.68,0:34:24.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,度假村？\N{\fs50}A resort?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:36.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你把我们的位置\N{\fs50}You're gonna point to where we are
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.40,0:34:39.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和你那个“度假村”标出来\N{\fs50}and where your "resort" is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:43.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,最好和你那个伙计标的是同一个地方\N{\fs50}And it better be the exact same spot your buddy points to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:44.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.05,0:35:01.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们就在这儿\N{\fs50}That's where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.22,0:35:03.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.43,0:35:06.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去问他 他会告诉你 我没撒谎\N{\fs50}Go ask him. He'll tell you. I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.52,0:35:12.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不！\N{\fs50}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.44,0:35:16.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的！耶稣啊！不！\N{\fs50}Shit! Jesus! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.90,0:35:20.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈为什么要这么做？！\N{\fs50}Why the fuck did you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.57,0:35:22.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他都告诉你了！\N{\fs50}He told you what you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.87,0:35:28.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的 操你妈\N{\fs50}You motherfucker. Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.33,0:35:30.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈什么都不会说\N{\fs50}I ain't tellin' you shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.25,0:35:33.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 没关系 我相信他 - 不 不\N{\fs50}- It's okay, I believe him. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.04,0:35:34.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.64,0:36:29.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论如何 这只是鹿肉 我发誓\N{\fs50}For what it's worth, this is just deer meat. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.77,0:36:34.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要把我剁成一块一块儿的\N{\fs50}You're gonna chop me up into little pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.77,0:36:37.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我宁可不这么做\N{\fs50}I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.19,0:36:40.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行行好 告诉我你的名字\N{\fs50}Please, just tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.11,0:36:46.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 如果你想评判我——  - 评判你？\N{\fs50}- If you wanna judge me-- - Judge you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.28,0:36:49.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你吃的是人 你他妈个变态！\N{\fs50}You're eating people, you sick fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:57.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:01.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只有几个人知道\N{\fs50}There are only a few of us that know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.13,0:37:02.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我本来要告诉你的\N{\fs50}But I would've told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.80,0:37:04.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或早或晚\N{\fs50}Sooner or later. I guess sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:06.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是头禽兽\N{\fs50}You're an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.37,0:37:07.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 是的 我们都是\N{\fs50}Well, yes, we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.30,0:37:08.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说到本质了\N{\fs50}That's sorta the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.02,0:37:13.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我这是逼不得已\N{\fs50}It was a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.18,0:37:15.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你以为我不感到羞耻吗？\N{\fs50}You think it doesn't shame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.81,0:37:17.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我能怎样呢？\N{\fs50}But what was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:19.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让他们挨饿吗？\N{\fs50}Let them starve?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:22.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些人把性命交到了我手上\N{\fs50}These people who put their lives in my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.28,0:37:25.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,指望我保护他们并爱戴着我 我不该吗？\N{\fs50}who expect me to keep them safe, who love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:26.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 也许是吧\N{\fs50}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.07,0:37:29.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你才不信呢\N{\fs50}You don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.37,0:37:32.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也不觉得你的朋友会信\N{\fs50}I don't think your friend would either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.75,0:37:35.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他不也为了救你而取了别人的性命吗？\N{\fs50}Didn't he take another man's life to save yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.08,0:37:37.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他那是自保\N{\fs50}He was defending himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.00,0:37:39.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他是在保护你\N{\fs50}He was defending you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:43.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你早就明白了\N{\fs50}But you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.63,0:37:46.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你见过不少事儿\N{\fs50}You see a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.30,0:37:47.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fs50}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.97,0:37:50.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道我看你的时候 我看见了什么吗？\N{\fs50}And you know what I see when I look at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.27,0:37:54.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fs50}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.39,0:37:57.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你让我想到了我自己\N{\fs50}You remind me of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.06,0:38:02.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是天生的领袖 你聪明又忠诚\N{\fs50}You're a natural leader, you're smart, loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.03,0:38:05.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,暴力\N{\fs50}Violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.37,0:38:11.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你根本不了解我\N{\fs50}You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.16,0:38:12.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我其实了解\N{\fs50}But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.87,0:38:15.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我现在放你出来\N{\fs50}If I let you out of that cage right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.25,0:38:17.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把你的刀还给你\N{\fs50}put that knife of yours in your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.46,0:38:19.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你眼都不眨就会刺向我\N{\fs50}you'd stick me in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.08,0:38:22.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你有颗暴力的心\N{\fs50}You have a violent heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:23.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这我当然知道\N{\fs50}And I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.72,0:38:30.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我一直有颗暴力的心\N{\fs50}I've always had a violent heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.89,0:38:35.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我曾经为此挣扎了很久\N{\fs50}And I struggled with it for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.68,0:38:38.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但之后世界完蛋了 而我找到了真理\N{\fs50}But then the world ended and I was shown the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.52,0:38:41.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 上帝指引你\N{\fs50}Right, by God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.77,0:38:42.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.94,0:38:45.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是虫草菌\N{\fs50}By Cordyceps.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:49.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,虫草菌是怎么做的？它邪恶吗？\N{\fs50}What does Cordyceps do? Is it evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.32,0:38:50.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.91,0:38:52.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它长势繁茂 它会繁殖\N{\fs50}It's fruitful. It multiplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.99,0:38:55.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它喂养 保护它的孩子\N{\fs50}It feeds and protects its children
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.37,0:38:58.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果有必要 它还会用暴力来保护自己的未来\N{\fs50}and it secures its future with violence, if it must.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.50,0:39:03.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它会爱\N{\fs50}It loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.67,0:39:08.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为什么和我说这些？\N{\fs50}Why are you telling me all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.30,0:39:10.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为你能承受\N{\fs50}Because you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.01,0:39:12.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而旁人承受不了\N{\fs50}The way the others can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.76,0:39:17.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们需要上帝 他们需要天堂\N{\fs50}They need God. They need heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.22,0:39:18.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们需要\N{\fs50}They need
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.56,0:39:21.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们需要一个父亲\N{\fs50}they need a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.98,0:39:24.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不用\N{\fs50}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:26.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你境界更高\N{\fs50}You're beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.82,0:39:29.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是个被羊群包围的牧羊人\N{\fs50}I'm a shepherd surrounded by sheep,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.99,0:39:31.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我只想要一个\N{\fs50}and all I want
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:34.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和我平等的人\N{\fs50}is an equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.12,0:39:38.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fs50}A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.08,0:39:41.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的朋友呢？\N{\fs50}What about my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.21,0:39:45.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就像我说的 你很忠诚\N{\fs50}Like I said, loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.67,0:39:52.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉他们别再找他了\N{\fs50}I can tell the others to stop looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.68,0:39:56.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们会饶过他\N{\fs50}They'll spare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:58.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fs50}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.35,0:39:59.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们会放他走？\N{\fs50}They'll just let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.98,0:40:00.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.06,0:40:05.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他要不来打扰我们 他们就会放他走\N{\fs50}If he leaves us in peace, they will just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.77,0:40:08.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说什么 他们就做什么\N{\fs50}They do what I tell them to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.49,0:40:12.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们跟随我\N{\fs50}They follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们也会跟随我们\N{\fs50}And they would follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.74,0:40:21.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,主知道我需要帮助 我——\N{\fs50}Lord knows I could use the help. I--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:23.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看看都发生了什么\N{\fs50}Look what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:31.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想想我们一起都能做些什么 我们这么强大\N{\fs50}Think of what we could do together, as strong as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.13,0:40:35.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以让这里变得完美\N{\fs50}We'd make this place perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:38.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会生长 会枝繁叶茂\N{\fs50}We'd grow, spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.39,0:40:42.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们愿意为我们的人民做任何事情\N{\fs50}And we'd do whatever we needed for our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.65,0:40:46.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想想我们可以给他们的生活\N{\fs50}Imagine the life we could give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.57,0:40:56.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想想我们一同打造的生活\N{\fs50}Imagine the life we could build.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.89,0:41:23.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你个小贱人\N{\fs50}You little cunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.94,0:41:30.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你等着瞧 看我要怎么和他们说\N{\fs50}Let's see what I go tell the others now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.78,0:41:32.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.24,0:41:35.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.49,0:41:38.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,告诉他们 就是小女孩艾莉\N{\fs50}Tell them that Ellie is the little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.37,0:41:40.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,掰烂了你的狗指头！\N{\fs50}who broke your fucking finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.33,0:41:43.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是怎么说的？\N{\fs50}How did you put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.58,0:41:46.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“剁成一块一块”？\N{\fs50}"Tiny little pieces"?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.90,0:43:41.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不！不！不！\N{\fs50}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:43.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fs50}Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.87,0:43:44.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放开！\N{\fs50}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.50,0:43:52.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 等等！\N{\fs50}Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.02,0:43:53.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fs50}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.58,0:43:55.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 等等！\N{\fs50}Wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.75,0:43:57.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别！别下手！求你了 不要！\N{\fs50}Don't! Don't do it! Please, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.59,0:43:59.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 求你了不要！不要！ - 你有过机会了\N{\fs50}- Please, don't! Don't! - You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.88,0:44:01.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我被感染了！\N{\fs50}I'm infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.13,0:44:03.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我被感染了！\N{\fs50}I'm infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.68,0:44:07.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在你也是了\N{\fs50}And now so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.77,0:44:12.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,卷起我的袖子 看清楚 看清楚了！\N{\fs50}Roll up my sleeve. Look at it. Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:22.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么说的？\N{\fs50}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.36,0:44:26.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凡事皆有缘由 对吧？\N{\fs50}Everything happens for a reason, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.41,0:44:28.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fs50}David.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.33,0:44:30.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.91,0:44:33.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不对 她早就该发作了 这不是真的\N{\fs50}No, she would've turned by now. This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.58,0:44:35.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看着挺他妈真的\N{\fs50}It looks pretty fuckin' real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:41.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无路可逃了 艾莉\N{\fs50}There's no way out, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.98,0:45:45.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,门都锁上了 钥匙在我这儿\N{\fs50}The doors are locked. And I have the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.57,0:45:49.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:53.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.46,0:46:00.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.46,0:46:03.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道你没感染\N{\fs50}I know you're not infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.71,0:46:07.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,被感染的人才不会有这么强的求生欲\N{\fs50}No one infected fights this hard to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.22,0:46:13.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你是怎么做到的？\N{\fs50}So, how did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.31,0:46:17.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的秘密是什么？\N{\fs50}What's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:22.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是说你他妈就这么特别？\N{\fs50}Or are you just that fucking special?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.53,0:46:26.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人喜欢被羞辱 艾莉\N{\fs50}No one likes being humiliated, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.40,0:46:29.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不知道我有多好！\N{\fs50}You don't know how good I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.33,0:46:33.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不知道我能给你什么！\N{\fs50}You don't know what I could've given you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.50,0:46:36.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只要你给我机会的话！\N{\fs50}If you had just let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.75,0:46:40.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 我有消息告诉你\N{\fs50}Well, I have news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.38,0:46:45.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们俩今天都不会死\N{\fs50}Neither one of us is dying today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.93,0:46:50.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你瞧 我改主意了\N{\fs50}You see, I've changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.18,0:46:52.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我认为你确实需要一个父亲\N{\fs50}I've decided you do need a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.93,0:46:54.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我要把你留在身边\N{\fs50}So I'm gonna keep you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.60,0:46:57.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后好好教育你\N{\fs50}and I'm gonna teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.73,0:47:00.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.24,0:47:08.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.33,0:47:16.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.64,0:47:40.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以为你早知道了呢\N{\fs50}I thought you already knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.27,0:47:43.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,反抗是我最喜欢的部分\N{\fs50}The fighting is the part I like the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.27,0:47:47.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fs50}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.44,0:47:49.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“爱里没有惧怕”\N{\fs50}"There's no fear in love."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.05,0:47:51.00,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,典出《圣经》约翰一书 4:18
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.12,0:48:37.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不！放开我！\N{\fs50}No! Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.83,0:48:38.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放开！\N{\fs50}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.49,0:48:40.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 放开——\N{\fs50}- It's me. - Get--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.04,0:48:42.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fs50}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.21,0:48:45.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 你看\N{\fs50}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.08,0:48:48.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是我 是我\N{\fs50}It's me. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.51,0:48:52.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 没事了 - 他——\N{\fs50}- It's okay. - He--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.18,0:48:54.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fs50}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.55,0:48:57.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事了 宝贝姑娘\N{\fs50}It's okay, baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.60,0:48:58.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\fs50}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.72,0:49:01.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\fs50}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.48,0:49:05.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
